    <command xml:space="preserve">examine apple</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">The golden apple has "RUN" inscribed on it!&#x000A;&#x000A;The floor collapses! You fall through a hole!&#x000A;&#x000A;Pit Room&#x000A;You fell into a dark pit. A trap door closed above you.&#x000A;&#x000A;Dropped.&#x000A;&#x000A;&#x000A;&#x000A;    *** You succumb to your injuries. Pro tip: drink more water. ***&#x000A;&#x000A;&#x000A;In that game you scored 0 out of a possible 100, in 4 turns.&#x000A;&#x000A;&#x000A;Would you like to RESTART, RESTORE a saved game, QUIT or UNDO the last command?&#x000A;&gt;</result>
