    <command xml:space="preserve">listen</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">Somewhere above you, you hear slow footsteps. Someone is walking. Unhurried.&#x000A;&#x000A;*** LALA VISION ***&#x000A;&#x000A;You see through Lala's eyes in her hidden chamber... She giggles and gestures toward a door above the pit.&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
