    <command xml:space="preserve">examine</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">(the gold coin)&#x000A;You see nothing special about the gold coin.&#x000A;&#x000A;Suddenly, you are not yourself.|You see through another's eyes. Everything feels lighter.&#x000A;&#x000A;Hidden chamber&#x000A;Soft light filters in. You feel powerful, watching the pit from afar. Your laughter echoes.&#x000A;&#x000A;Suddenly, you are Lala! You are in your hidden chamber, sensing the fallen one (Petar) far below in the pit. Your laughter echoes.&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
